WEBVTT

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:07.530
Our plan to seize the DTO planning data and appeal to the Chairman ended in failure,

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:10.370
and we ended up just
waiting to be expelled.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:14.410
At this point we no longer felt any drive to fight back,

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:18.380
no anger, or even any sorrow.

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:22.310
All of our spirits had been utterly broken.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.730
Kiyoshi-dono, as long as we are cleaning the lavatory,

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.410
we may as well kill two birds with one stone and answer nature's call first!

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:32.180
With one exception.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.430
Kill two birds with one stone, how?

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.420
Don't mind him.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:37.830
Leave it to you, Gakuto.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:38.650
Great idea.

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:40.810
Come, gentlemen! Let us relieve ourselves!

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:43.040
Yours truly's idea is
free of charge this time,

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.140
and you are free to use it!

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.280
His spirit wasn't so much broken as it was demolished...

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.580
It appears that they have completely
accepted their expulsions, haven't they?

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.710
They're so submissive, it's almost anticlimactic.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:01.040
In just a few more days, we will finally purge the school of that scum.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:03.320
Won't that be refreshing?

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:08.050
Yes.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.580
The boys' food.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:44.360
Thank you.

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:50.450
The day after next...

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:52.540
The chairman will approve it,

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:54.450
and your expulsion will
be formally concluded.

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:56.740
They say that in America,
in the state of Texas,

00:02:56.740 --> 00:03:00.080
condemned prisoners were once allowed to choose their last meal.

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:00.870
If you think about it,

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:03.540
the day after next will be like your execution day.

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:05.900
So, tell me what you'd like to eat.

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:08.190
Uh, well, I'd like hamburger.

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:09.840
Steak.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:11.360
I'll take katsudon.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.760
I'll stick with my regular menu.

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.510
Dirty Four-eyes, what about you?

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.510
Yours truly would like deep-fried grasshoppers over rice!

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:19.390
The fancy variety,
it goes without saying.

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:20.980
Very well. Approved.

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:22.100
Approved?!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.900
Um, is it okay if I change my order?

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.020
To what?

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:29.350
As an appetizer, I'd like the vice president's crop,

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.780
and for the main dish, I'd like a storm of toe-kicks and stomping,

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:34.860
then finally, for dessert, I'd like the vice president to spit on me.

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.450
Denied, those are not
food items. That is all.

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:39.830
The day after next
is our last day, huh?

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:47.880
"It's Chiyo. How are you?
I know, there's no way you're okay.

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:51.830
If you can write a reply, leave a little bit of bread,

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:54.310
and please place your message inside it."

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:57.340
Chiyo-chan... What a great girl.

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.560
Damn it, I can't believe we have to part ways, too.

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:00.560
I saw that.

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:01.590
Gentlemen!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:04.230
Kiyoshi-dono has received
a note from a girl!

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.060
So? What's the harm?

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:06.830
Mm-hmm.

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:11.380
It's all over anyways...

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:14.710
Over? That certainly is true.

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:17.740
If we use this, we can nullify our expulsion, after all.

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:18.920
Huh?

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.910
I see it, our means of escape!

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:25.920
Gakuto, don't tell me you were <i>pretending</i> you'd gone nuts!

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.700
Like Oishi Kuranosuke, right?

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:29.380
That's cool.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.210
Hurry up and tell us the plan!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.380
We will get out by hiding ourselves within the leftover food, too!

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:36.470
I'll go in the soup!

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:38.050
You hide within the bread crumbs!

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:39.170
Come, gentlemen!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:42.010
Let us escape this world of oppression with haste!

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.660
That's Gakuto for you.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.710
Incredible.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:48.130
A brilliant idea.

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:54.400
Two more days, huh?

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.110
"Chiyo-chan, thank you.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:58.200
And, farewell."

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:04.730
Are Kiyoshi-kun and the others really getting expelled tomorrow?

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:14.800
Here is your last supper.

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:16.140
Eat with gratitude.

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:17.300
Awesome!

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:20.900
Yours truly's looks the most scrumptious of them all!

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.530
Gakuto, are you seriously
planning to eat that?

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:25.520
Come back to your senses! Those are grasshoppers!

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:27.330
You really shouldn't eat that.

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:28.520
Won't you upset your stomach?

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:29.990
Shaddup!

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:31.480
Don't touch my grasshoppers!

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:32.590
I get it!

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:35.950
You're all out to purloin yours truly's delicious dinner!

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:37.190
If that's your game...

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.590
Come at me with the intent to kill!

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:39.530
Knock it off!

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:42.200
Shut up and eat!

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:45.700
Wow, I've never had meat this tender before.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.460
Ah, this is good.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:50.120
It's great to get to eat whatever you want.

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:51.270
Huh?

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:53.500
Another missive without any future?

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:57.410
I declare, Kiyoshi-dono, what a horny toad of a prisoner you are!

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:03.700
Hey, are you okay?

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:05.510
Just how devastating was that?

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:08.520
I just had... a flash...!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:10.870
A means of escape just
came to me in a flash!

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.610
What, are we going to ride your grasshoppers out of here?

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:14.410
This is no time for your asinine jokes!

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.780
Hurry up and finish your meals.

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:21.370
What manner of foul cuisine is this?!

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.270
What? It's grasshoppers over rice, right?

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:25.330
Grasshoppers?! Why is there such a thing in my food?!

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.750
Terrible! This is someone's idea of a dirty trick!

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:30.770
What are you talking about?
You asked for it yourself, didn't you?

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:32.660
I do not recall asking for such a thing!

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:34.590
You don't mean, you're...

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:36.490
You're back in your right mind?!

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:39.420
Right mind, nothing. Why is yours truly the only one with such eccentric fare?

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:40.880
Never mind that!

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:42.760
Gakuto, you thought of something, didn't you?!

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:43.680
Mm-hmm.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:48.230
Kiyoshi-dono, when I saw Chiyo-chan's missive, I thought of something.

00:06:48.230 --> 00:06:50.730
One last means of escape.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.430
Are you working on
something, Chairman?

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:53.940
Mm-hmm.

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:57.270
I had some miscellaneous business left over... here.

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.900
Miscellaneous business, you say?

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:00.650
Miscellaneous business...

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:01.400
Yes!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.040
Very well, then.

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:06.450
Tomorrow is the day I tell that schoolyard scum that they are expelled.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:10.050
Please do not delay in the processing of your duties.

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:12.160
Yes, I will make sure of...

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:12.830
it.

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:17.170
Also, could I ask you to no longer do your "miscellaneous business" at school?

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:18.890
It's disgusting.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.340
Please excuse me.

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:30.760
I need some blinds...

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:31.480
don't I?

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:33.640
...and that is the plan.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:36.060
We begin moving tomorrow, gentlemen!

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:40.900
Hm-hm, it appears that yours truly's brilliant plan has astonished you all into speechlessness.

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:43.150
No, it's not that.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:43.620
Hmm?

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.750
Any way you cut it, it's impossible.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.330
We do it with full knowledge that it may be so!

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:49.790
I mean, we're getting expelled tomorrow!

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:50.570
Huh?

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:52.690
What?

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:55.110
Have so many days
truly already elapsed?!

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:56.400
What do we do?!

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:58.930
However you look at it,
this plan needs two more days!

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:01.510
"What do we do?"
That's what <i>we'd</i> like to know!

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:03.530
If we are to be expelled tomorrow morning,

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.260
then this plan is indeed impossible.

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:07.930
Suppertime is over.

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:10.060
There's something I want you all to fill out now.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:11.970
Your withdrawal requests.

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:17.440
You know, once you guys are gone, this school will be quiet again.

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:21.690
Don't tell me... she's going to miss us?

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.320
Well, it will be a relief—

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:31.130
She is quivering.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:33.450
Does this mean she
will miss our presence?

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.370
Vice President, wipe away those tears.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.510
We, too, will never forget the days that we spent

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:39.840
with you, Vice President.

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:43.030
Do <i>not</i> waste food!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.260
Fill out your withdrawal
requests, you scum!

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:49.760
I thought we were about to have a tender moment,

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:51.100
but I was completely wrong.

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.060
Is your head okay, Gakuto?

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.180
Of course it is not okay.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.640
There's no time for rest.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.480
Let's put your plan into action!

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:01.540
It is impossible.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:04.740
Yours truly's plan requires more time.

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:06.060
We'll manage somehow.

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:07.920
Manage how?

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:09.110
We're all out of options.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.590
We'll write an appeal to the chairman.

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:13.450
To the chairman?

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.770
Yeah.

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:17.620
We'll send an appeal along
with our withdrawal forms.

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:22.290
If we plead that the Underground Student Council set this "DTO" trap for us...

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.970
Yes... it might buy us a few days while he investigates.

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:29.290
If we're given a reprieve...

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:33.600
...then we can use that time to find the DTO evidence with Gakuto-kun's plan.

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:36.210
But isn't this a little thin
to pin our hopes on?

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:38.070
Remember, Shingo!

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:40.750
We can't afford to leave
this school just yet!

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.190
At least not until summer...

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:44.150
and the wet T-shirt contest!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.810
We can't give up!

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:49.200
Or don't you want to see nipples through wet T-shirts?!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.400
I do.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.160
Of course I do!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:54.320
I can't hear you!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.490
What do you want to see?!

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.280
Nipples!

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.700
Pointy nipples through wet T-shirts!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.380
I wanna see them so bad!

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:05.630
Then, don't give up
hope until the very end!

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.990
I feel like I've forgotten something.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:18.230
In the nurse's office, that one day...

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:19.620
What was it?

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:23.520
It feels like it was something that can't be undone...

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.400
Have you finished, you scum?

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:26.540
Yes.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:29.310
What is this?

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:30.990
It's an appeal.

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.900
An appeal?

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.490
We know it won't do any good,

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:38.450
but we want the chairman to know how sorry we are.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:41.670
Please! It has our
final feelings written on it!

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:45.170
Hmph, how pitiful, when you know it won't do any good.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:46.880
Very well, I'll allow it.

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:48.550
Thank you very much!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:04.860
It's late.

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:07.820
Never mind our breakfast, <i>no one</i> is coming.

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:12.200
Are we really going to be expelled today?

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:16.200
It depends on whether or not the chairman reads our appeal and comes down here.

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:18.080
Maybe it really is hopeless.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:21.080
It's all right. I'm sure he read it.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.970
Then why isn't the chairman coming down here?!

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.400
Well...

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:30.630
The vice president! Which means...

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:34.390
As scheduled, you are to be expelled today.

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.100
All of you, out of the prison.

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:41.560
I order you to go collect all of your belongings still in the dorms.

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:43.590
This is your last task.

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:48.060
I don't want any trace, not so much as a single hair, to remain here.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.030
I-Is this...?

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:54.850
How cruel, Vice President!

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:57.250
How could you tear up our appeal?!

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.200
This is beyond cruel!

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.370
I thought you agreed!

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:01.620
No talking.

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:03.160
Keep quiet and walk.

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:10.110
Those boys are being expelled today.

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:13.410
I guess I won't get to pay that idiot Kiyoshi back after all.

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:17.140
Well, when I see him for the last time, I'll make do with punching him in the stomach—

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.400
What was that?

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:22.120
I came close to remembering something yesterday, too.

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:23.600
But why...?

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:30.690
Almost there...

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:45.580
It all ends now.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:48.960
These are truly your "thirteen steps."

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:51.600
Do you have any last words?

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:56.260
Why don't you let me be the one...

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:57.970
to hear their last...

00:12:58.190 --> 00:12:58.940
words?!

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:03.810
Chairman!

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:05.710
What is the chairman doing here?

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:08.410
I <i>know</i> I tore up their appeal.

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:13.190
What did you do?

00:13:13.190 --> 00:13:16.000
Now, let's return to the prison.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.200
I need to have a word with you all.

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:20.910
Can I get a cup of...

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:21.780
tea?!

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:24.000
Oh, yes.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:26.060
Why did the chairman come down here?

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:27.410
I am unaware.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:30.710
The vice president tore up our appeal.

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:33.050
Why those rotten...

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.920
Just how did they do it?

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.260
A dummy.

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:37.980
A dummy?

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:38.830
Yeah.

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:41.990
The appeal that we wrote was a dummy.

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:44.430
I put the real bait in
my withdrawal request.

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:48.690
I figured that after the vice president threw our appeal out, she'd let her guard down,

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:51.270
and she wouldn't look at the withdrawal requests closely.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:52.770
You are a genius!

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:57.050
That's just like the ploy used by the famous strategist Pang Tong at the Battle of Red Cliffs!

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:58.950
I'm not sure what that was, but you're probably right.

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:01.470
So, what did you write as bait on your withdrawal request?

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:02.530
Well...

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:05.120
I received your message.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:07.250
But let me come right out and say this—

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:08.840
As an educator,

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:11.710
blackmail is something I do not give in... to!

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:13.290
Blackmail?!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:17.010
Surely enough, it's something that the chairman wants to hide.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:21.140
I had no choice but to use what I saw that day to call the chairman out.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:25.060
It's my trump card to get the chairman to postpone our expulsions.

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:27.720
Damn it, I can't hear them from here!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:34.360
Hana...?

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:35.690
Where is he?

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:37.400
That bastard, Kiyoshi!

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:39.360
Where is he?!

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:40.860
You misunderstand.

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:44.030
I didn't think you would hear us out unless I mentioned that.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:47.160
We really were set up by the
Underground Student Council.

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:49.500
